<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish Dec producer output prices fall 0.1 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>Irish Dec producer output prices fall 0.1 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish output prices for the manufacturing industries fell 0.1 percent in December and were down 1.5 percent from a year ago, Central Statistics Office data showed on Friday.</p>
<p>		  Index (base 1985)   Monthly change   Yearly change</p>
<p>Latest month	   119.5		  -0.1	     -1.5</p>
<p>Previous month	 119.6		  unch	     -1.6</p>
<p>Year-ago month	 121.3		  -0.2	     +3.6</p>
<p>-- Dublin newsroom 353 1 661 3377</p>
